{"id":"A3","doc":"A","title":"Hardware Revision Details","words":45,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"link","href":"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-dev-kits/en/latest/esp32s3/esp32-s3-devkitc-1/user_guide_v1.0.html","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Initial release"}]}]}]},{"t":"quote","c":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}]},{"t":"text","v":" Both the initial and v1.1 versions of ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 are available on the market."}],"warn":true},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The main difference lies in the GPIO assignment for the RGB LED: the initial version uses "},{"t":"pin","v":"GPIO48","n":48},{"t":"text","v":", whereas v1.1 uses "},{"t":"pin","v":"GPIO38","n":38},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]}]}